---
title: "Advanced Medical Care"
code: "EMS-183"
category: "emergency-medical-services"
credits: "2"
prerequisites: []
corequisites:
  - "2026/EMS-184"
prerequisiteNote: "Prerequisite: Current Virginia EMT and CPR certification as approved by the Virginia Office of EMS."
corequisiteNote: "Corequisite: EMS 184"
---

Examines the assessment and management of medical emergencies as outlined by the National Emergency Medical Service Education Standards (NEMSES) within the Advanced EMT curriculum. Lecture 2 hours. Total 2 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
